
# Cloudflare Workers view handle: the node one, since ./dom bears the node in-memory dom, whose tasks take and return
# node's `view`. Spelled out here because cloudflare otherwise borrows browser, so ../../view bore browser's `view`
# while ./dom typed every node by node's, and a Worker build split the two (`expected view__in0_0, found view__in0_1`
# at view/native/cloudflare/host.tree).

bear @term/site/dom/native/node/view
